# Repository root — ignore rules apply to all paths below.

## Build outputs (.NET / MSBuild)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
[Bb]uild/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

## Compiled / generated binaries (also covered by bin/obj; explicit for stray copies)
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache
*.ilk
*.log
*.vspscc
*.vssscc

## NuGet / MSBuild extras
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

