.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.suo
*.rsuser

## JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## VS Code (uncomment to ignore all local VS Code settings)
# .vscode/

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

